5,1,1,talk,Mizuki,,Quarter-end reporting is a mess. I need to know how a new holding affects our audit trail.,"{""words"":17,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
6,1,1,talk,Jonathan,,"I am curious about the human cost. Who actually shows up to work for us, and how long does it take to find them?","{""words"":24,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
7,1,1,talk,Shizue,,I am curious about the stories we tell. I want to see which past wins actually kept their customers.,"{""words"":19,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
8,1,1,talk,Misaki,,I am worried about our cash flow. I need to see what follow-on calls will demand from us in the years after a first round.,"{""words"":25,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
9,1,1,talk,Shion,,Late deliveries are the real risk. I need to know what external obstacles actually stalled our last two cohorts.,"{""words"":19,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
10,1,2,talk,Mizuki,,"@Jonathan, if we cannot verify the numbers, the human cost is irrelevant. I need clean data first.","{""words"":17,""mentions"":[""Jonathan""],""raw_differs"":false}"
11,1,2,talk,Jonathan,,"@Mizuki, clean data is vital, but if we cannot staff the team, the numbers are just theory. I need to know who is available.","{""words"":24,""mentions"":[""Mizuki""],""raw_differs"":false}"
12,1,2,talk,Shizue,,"@Mizuki, I agree. But @Jonathan, I worry the stories we tell are hollow. I want to see if our past wins actually kept their customers.","{""words"":25,""mentions"":[""Mizuki"",""Jonathan""],""raw_differs"":false}"
13,1,2,talk,Misaki,,"@Shion, delivery delays often mean unbudgeted cash outflows. I need to know if those stalls drained our reserves.","{""words"":18,""mentions"":[""Shion""],""raw_differs"":false}"
14,1,2,talk,Shion,,"@Misaki, delays drain cash, yes. But I need to know the specific external blockers. I will check the delivery records of two holdings.","{""words"":23,""mentions"":[""Misaki""],""raw_differs"":false}"
15,1,3,talk,Mizuki,,"@Shion, delivery delays complicate our reporting. I will check the independent checks on holdings' reported figures to ensure accuracy.","{""words"":19,""mentions"":[""Shion""],""raw_differs"":false}"
16,1,3,talk,Jonathan,,"@Shion, those records will show the bottlenecks. I will check the retained recruiters' placement times to see who we can actually hire.","{""words"":22,""mentions"":[""Shion""],""raw_differs"":false}"
17,1,3,talk,Shizue,,"@Misaki, cash flow is vital. I will check account retention through price rises to see who truly stayed.","{""words"":18,""mentions"":[""Misaki""],""raw_differs"":false}"
18,1,3,talk,Misaki,,"@Shizue, retention is key to future cash. I will check the terms of last winter's credit line to see what we can borrow against.","{""words"":24,""mentions"":[""Shizue""],""raw_differs"":false}"
19,1,3,talk,Shion,,I will also check the security review time before first deployment. That is often the hidden external bottleneck.,"{""words"":18,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
20,1,4,talk,Mizuki,,I will also check the appraisal needs at the last audit. That tells me exactly what external verification we face.,"{""words"":20,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
21,1,4,talk,Jonathan,,I will also check the adviser bench and partner board seats. That shows who is actually available to help us right now.,"{""words"":22,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
22,1,4,talk,Shizue,,I will also check the profile of the exits and the write-off. I want to see the full picture of what actually worked.,"{""words"":23,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
23,1,4,talk,Misaki,,I will also check the reserve accounts and follow-on calls. I need to know exactly what future obligations will drain our liquidity.,"{""words"":22,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
